/v1/","context":{"app_id":4759190,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4759190","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T09:47:27Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4994400","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4759190-1847286114040391","game_id":"steam-4759190","kind":"update","title":"Small Update","summary":"Greetings, Operators!Following reports about the User Experience of the Remote Operator Terminal, we made the following change:Audio OptionsAdded a Toggle to pause playing music on focus loss (default OFF).This new setting will enable you to listen to all the tracks even when tabbing out of the Software. We're sure this will help increase productivity and concentration.Good luck in your future operations!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T18:30:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040391","verified_at":"2026-10-24T22:59:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4759190-1843481262696173","game_id":"steam-4759190","kind":"update","title":"Another small Update","summary":"To all Operators,Hullet Corporation is proud to announce that the Remote Control Terminal received another round of updates to further improve your efficiency.Here's a detailed list of all improvements.Task SelectionIt's possible to go directly to Task Selection from the Pause Menu without the need to exit to the main menu.Loading the Task Selection screen is significantly faster nowControlsDefault keyboard bindings were further optimized. Any existing bindings remain as they are set. The change","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T18:47:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696173","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4759190-1843481262690085","game_id":"steam-4759190","kind":"update","title":"Small Update","summary":"For better clarity, the Task Selection screen has ben reworked to better represent its function. Instead of only showing Buttons with a Name, it now includes a description and information about the progress so far.Here is what it looks likeAs you can see, the Operator playing the Demo arriving at this screenshot has completed both Asset Recovery 101 and Project Acoustic Anomaly - even with all gold trophies - as indicated by the green checkmark. The Advanced Operations Preview is still in progre","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T18:03:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690085","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4759190-1842846814447384","game_id":"steam-4759190","kind":"announcement","title":"Linux Support","summary":"Cubic Color Confusion now natively supports Linux!The following changes are included in this update:GeneralNative Linux SupportCross-Platform progress between Windows & LinuxMulti-Display support should now work for both Windows & LinuxFixed replay recorder not using normalized grid axes which could render replays invalidTooltips for the ingame-HUD buttons now show current bindingsControlsAnalog Sticks now use the predominant axis only instead of sending multiple inputsAdded missing Gamepad butt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T17:41:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814447384","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4759190-1841579228664794","game_id":"steam-4759190","kind":"update","title":"Demo Content Update","summary":"Greetings, Operator!After reviewing initial Operator Trial data, Cubic Corporation has decided to expand upon the provided challenges. We have granted every Candidate access to two additional Sectors of Project Acoustic Anomaly and provided an additional preview simulation for those wishing to prove themselves against more intricate challenges.We look forward to reviewing the additional data generated by these new Challenges.F.W. Taylor, Lead Project Manager Attachment 1: Change LogTwo additiona","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T08:45:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228664794","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4759190-1840944183789180","game_id":"steam-4759190","kind":"update","title":"First minor update!","summary":"Based on user feedback, i made some small improvements across the board.Here's an overview of what changed:Broken TilesVisibility of Broken Tiles has been improved by using a darker tint for the tiles and rotating them based on their position in the grid. Broken tiles should be easier to identify now.Music PlayerThe music player player has a new icon next to the currently playing track so it identifies as a music player. Player controls now start in a collapsed state and can be expanded/collapse","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T15:57:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183789180","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4759190-1840310314351585","game_id":"steam-4759190","kind":"announcement","title":"Only one week until the demo will be available!","summary":"On August 17th, in just one week, the public demo of Cubic Color Confusion will be available to everyone!I'm so excited to finally be able to share what I've been working on for so long with all of you.See you on launch day — and get those brain cells ready!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-10T13:45:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314351585","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4759190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:58Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:58Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4759190":"2026-10-26T04:02:58Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4759190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4994400":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:58Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:02:58Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4759190","app_id":4759190,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:55Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c873611ac35315422561c4144efba414664d525a2d3c9dcd57c89d91d696b73e","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"독특한 색상 변경 시스템으로 여러 수를 앞서 생각해야 하는 퍼즐 게임입니다. 매번 움직일 때마다 퍼즐의 상태가 바뀌어 새로운 길이 열리고 다른 길은 닫힙니다. 점점 더 머리를 써야 하는 레벨을 돌파하며 혼란스러워 보이는 상황 속에서 질서를 찾아보세요.\r\n\r\n모든 도전을 극복할 수 있을까요?","publishers":[{"name":"eyesolated"}],"developers":[{"name":"eyesolated"}]},"rel